# ── FLOW: LIFECYCLE EVENT (COMMON) ──────────────────────────────────

@When "^opens lifecycle action '(allocation|novation remaining|partial novation remaining|step out full|step out partial|early termination|partial termination|portfolio reassignment)' for current trade$"
    When page trade portal searches and opens action menu for trade stored as 'createdTradeId'
    And page trade portal $1 action button is visible
    And page trade portal clicks $1 action for current trade
    And component dynamic action dialog is visible

@When "^submits '(novation remaining|step out full|step out partial|early termination|partial termination|portfolio reassignment)' lifecycle event and waits for page ready$"
    When confirm '$1' event form using configured risk engine mode for trade stored as 'createdTradeId'
    And component trade change confirmation dialog is visible
    And page trade portal confirms trade change and waits for New Today Blotter to reload

@When "^submits '(novation remaining|step out full|step out partial|early termination|partial termination|portfolio reassignment)' lifecycle event and stores the new trade id$"
    When confirm '$1' event form using configured risk engine mode for trade stored as 'createdTradeId'
    And component trade change confirmation dialog is visible
    And page trade portal confirms trade change, captures response as 'lifecycleEventResponse' and waits for New Today Blotter to reload
    And store e2e response field 'data.results[0].childTradeIds[0]' from stored variable 'lifecycleEventResponse' as 'newTradeId'

# The event was started from the blotter, which the page reloaded after it: the rows are checked where they are.
@Then "^the trade remains Live and is marked as Amended$"
    Then page trade portal blotter row of trade stored as 'createdTradeId' shows status 'LIVE' and event status 'Amended'

@Then "^the original trade is closed as Novated$"
    Then page trade portal blotter row of trade stored as 'createdTradeId' shows status 'DEAD' and event status 'Novated'

@Then "^the original trade is closed as Novated and new novated trade is live$"
    Then page trade portal blotter row of trade stored as 'newTradeId' shows status 'LIVE' and event status 'Novated'
    And page trade portal blotter row of trade stored as 'createdTradeId' shows status 'DEAD' and event status 'Novated'

@Then "^the trade remains Live and is marked as Novated$"
    Then page trade portal blotter row of trade stored as 'createdTradeId' shows status 'LIVE' and event status 'Novated'
